    "notes": "Exact Steam pin of the self-hosted server package head observed 2026-11-10 (depot 4754532 manifest 796742959979968000): image bundle 2180427-0-shipping (in-game v1.5.20.1), code branch sb-1.5.20.0. A battlegroup upgraded from linux-26223037 (sb-1.5.15.0) must rename its database from dune_sb_1_5_15_0 to dune_sb_1_5_20_0 and point DUNE_PG_URL at the new name (README, upgrade steps); updatedb applies the outstanding patches on first boot. All eleven pinned files hashed identically over two independent downloads (takaro-maint steam pin and a separate DepotDownloader fetch); igw-postgres.tar, the operators version and both scripts are byte-identical to linux-26223037. The plugin's resolver re-validated on the new map binary (ELF build id 2b8ac409013998b47804d0823c934ef73b124abc): the three required symbols resolved and the ProcessEvent slot (86) was confirmed. It is the default because the public client moved with it (client app 1172710 build 26548928, in-game v1.5.20.1.2180427). Everything said about install and verification in the linux-25689360 record applies here unchanged: no anonymous boot (an operator Funcom self-hosting token is required), no `takaro-maint install` seam for the image bundle, and `verification.required` stays `contract` with runtime proof recorded on the dev rig."
  },
